{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a44026da54360c2602bd58e178da893d7c507bd1bd3492f905a41c4784771649", "ja": "（七夕祭りのステージは無事に終了。その後、\n伊織の要望で、夜の海辺を散歩することになった）", "zh": "（七夕祭典的舞台顺利结束了。之后，应伊织的要求，我们决定去夜晚的海边散步）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "9b5c2aea85877c1a1d621a848ad8686db00ee23c7504186b9073fd2d0db91b47", "ja": "ようやく一段落ね。まったく、七夕の夜まで\n仕事だなんて、アイドルも楽じゃないわ。", "zh": "终于告一段落了。真是的，连七夕的晚上都要工作，偶像也不是那么轻松嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "1a6e6d23051646448dfed7db699d3c3737f6a1cf6ca9c0c484bdd39cead37c6f", "ja": "けど「伊織ちゃんに会いたい」っていうファンの願いを\n叶えてあげるのも、大事な務めよね。にひひっ♪", "zh": "不过，实现粉丝“想见伊织”的愿望，也是很重要的职责呢。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c1b4cd2b530279670e9b4cfabd34f45c9454bacce3dd66f33f39cd1f34294ffb", "ja": "遅くまでありがとな、伊織。でも、疲れたなら、\n早く事務所に帰ったほうがよかったんじゃないか？", "zh": "谢谢你陪到这么晚，伊织。不过，要是累了，早点回事务所不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "c64f67efbb55e32dc17355e113d075c398f46c2a381aa2f0451355fb131ef55d", "ja": "あら？　せっかくの七夕なんだもの。\nいいロケーションで見たいじゃない？　ほら見て、空！", "zh": "哎呀？难得过一次七夕嘛。\n当然想在景色好的地方看咯？快看，夜空！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "627d047ceed4737ec3dcc598c4634e3cc288921af9aef4363eb3506e2e94a8bb", "ja": "どう？　{$P$}。これでも、\n早く帰った方がよかったなんて言えるかしら？", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}。这样你还说得出早点回去比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1006_p", "source_sha256": "437f490575ffbf8a75bc3ce088e12086be52cdd13d578c4cc327037c48ed27bd", "ja": "確かに、これは圧巻だな……。", "zh": "确实，这真是壮观……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "9d0b045d543d5b737b6380e048869c3ada6bcef1fc23bf3b59cd2462cdcded0a", "ja": "どれが織姫と彦星かしら？　あの赤い星？\nそれとも、こっちの青い星？　ねえ、わかる？", "zh": "哪颗是织女星和牛郎星呢？是那颗红色的星星？\n还是这边那颗蓝色的星星？呐，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1008_p", "source_sha256": "36523933fcaf29ce0296e09d718181f5b53071ded52ac8e02bc055aa2d3c9659", "ja": "ええと、確かベガとアルタイルだろ？　一等星で、\n天の川を挟んでて、ええとつまり……どれだ？", "zh": "呃，我记得应该是织女星和牛郎星吧？都是一等星，隔着银河，然后，也就是说……到底是哪两颗来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "fc6accb1f5c8ffc42770cab30bb1bf2880766c23682faf3a752aced19c399158", "ja": "もう、まどろっこしいわね。決めたわ！\n今年はあれとあれってことにしときましょう。", "zh": "真是的，太磨蹭了。我决定了！\n今年就当成是那个跟那个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1010_p", "source_sha256": "95f625d5e21a9ba350124f256c5c5d0ab017b5f6afaad0c3f337eb9abadd953b", "ja": "そんな無茶苦茶な。ちゃんと敬わないと、\n神様が気を悪くするかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "这也太乱来了。不好好表示敬意的话，神明大人可能会不高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e82f4558c75b851a107e5779828c0787d124a4dd6fc800a035b023b37d3ca97", "ja": "あら、大丈夫よ。むこうは年に一度の大切なデート中\nだもの。そんな細かいこと、いちいち気にしないわ。", "zh": "哎呀，没事的啦。对方现在可是在一年一度的重要约会中呢。才不会去计较这种鸡毛蒜皮的小事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "16260e69e6f88efd7e9bfe019cbe0f0cc4f881edd42b7879e3f4b71e06f5cded", "ja": "それに、敬ってないわけじゃないわよ？\n私、これでも織姫星には憧れているもの。", "zh": "而且，我也不是不敬重她啦？我其实也很憧憬织女星呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d34ac547c95eaf09027e5b25cc5b17f226d6d335aaf6c0bf59dcaf9b25423564", "ja": "へえ……、伊織もああいう\nロマンティックな恋愛とかに興味があるんだな。", "zh": "原来如此……伊织也对那种浪漫的恋爱感兴趣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "06181b6cc30ed2a0a8fba41a0223e62e223084535434e4dcf6462d974ee7d397", "ja": "もう、そうじゃなくて、星になるってとこがいいのよ。\n伊織星なんていうのがあったら、素敵だと思わない？", "zh": "真是的，我说的不是那个，我是觉得变成星星这一点很好。\n要是有一颗叫“伊织星”的星星，不觉得很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "fe80a44bbe1c6a5a37cdaa99e434444da21813d4d3b15012829f672f0d044678", "ja": "ほら、あの白くてキレイな星なんか良さそうだわ。\nそれで、その下の小さいやつがあんたの星ね。", "zh": "你看，那颗又白又漂亮的星星就很不错。\n然后，下面那颗小一点的就是你的星星啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1016_p", "source_sha256": "abdfc0d570a7b802f4721a93c4b68a85a03ad3661c5517d7e08e795c7204afbf", "ja": "え？　俺も星になるのか？", "zh": "诶？我也要变成星星吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "9c026aa852ffe368dc001fe97e39aeb0df1fc63f53769fdc5ae5005f12ded04d", "ja": "当たり前じゃない。あんたは私のプロデューサー\nなんだから。そばにいるのは当然でしょ？", "zh": "这不是理所当然的吗。你可是我的制作人\n啊。待在身边不是理所应当的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1018_p", "source_sha256": "604c754b0d244bc39f8d61460dc645792a8a814e5a5c5cfccfc4edddce84b8d6", "ja": "なるほど、それもそうか。でも、それなら……\nものすごく長い付き合いになりそうだな。", "zh": "原来如此，这么说也有道理。不过这样的话……看来我们会相处非常非常久啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0283_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "aa60888043df67fc23e84a7d06095c6ff51a33c13593d83eda805e28e0fae6be", "ja": "ええ、夜空に星が輝くかぎり、ずーっと、\nあんたは私のプロデューサーよ。にひひっ♪", "zh": "嗯，只要夜空中的星星还在闪耀，你就永远都是我的制作人。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
